  "sourceSummary": "Legend Fitness original LeverEDGE6007 product description explicitly supports neutral-grip exercises with rotating handles and verifies a plate-loaded preacher machine with independent direct rigid levers and loading pegs, no cams/cables. This candidate uses a generic two-lever mechanism, not a dimensional replica. WeightTraining.guide original machine preacher tutorial specifies upperarm pad support aligned with shoulders, curl toward shoulders, stationary body, controlled return near extension. Its count-of-two squeeze is represented by editorial brief peak hold, not a literal2seconds.",
  "motion": "Seated bilateral plate-loaded preacher curl on independent rigid lever arms, both moving simultaneously. Neutral handles with palms facing each other, upperarms fixed on contoured31.5degree pad, elbows aligned to machine rotation axis in Y/Z. Each handle and plate horn remains rigidly linked to its pivot. Grounded feet and fixed torso. No cables or floating free barbell.",
